ing", "why": "Relates to a different process (Z+jets) and not specifically to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:l1-trigger-timing", "why": "This is related to the ECAL but concerns the trigger timing, not the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_bkg_desc_jpsi_cr", "why": "This is about the parameterization of the background function in a specific fit, not related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_fonll_reweight", "why": "This is about the uncertainty in FONLL scale factors, which is not directly related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-isr-fsr", "why": "This is about the uncertainty in the modeling of initial- and final-state radiation in top quark production, not related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:photon_energy_nonlinearity", "why": "This is about the nonlinearity of the photon energy scale, which is not directly related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-total-uncertainty", "why": "This is about the total background uncertainty in the signal region, not related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:br_hgammagamma", "why": "This is about the uncertainty in the branching fraction of the Higgs boson decay, not related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:twz-modelling", "why": "This is about the uncertainty in the modeling of $tWZ$ processes, not related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbarZ_theory", "why": "This is about the uncertainty in the modeling of $t\bar{t}+W/Z$ processes, not related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:met-modelling", "why": "This is about the uncertainty in the modeling of missing transverse energy, not related to the material in front of the ECAL."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:emu_cr_statistical", "why": "This i