{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-355bd42b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM:\n\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of WH and ZH production in the H→bb decay channel in pp collisions at 13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- 2103.04956: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2103.06956: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at √s=13 TeV\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using H→bb decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the WW boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of t̄tZ production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2511.11853: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2602.18611: Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength measurement\n- 2604.21670: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\n- 2604.27044: Resolved Run 3 analysis, first approach (transformer-based) HH results\n- 2604.27044: Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH→4b result\n- 2604.27044: Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH→4b result", 