ates a different background (prompt backgrounds) in the SS dilepton channel, not charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:misid_hadron", "why": "Estimates a different background (misidentified hadrons) in the electron channel, not charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:ttbar-2lOS", "why": "Estimates a different background (dileptonic top-antitop) in the 2ℓOS channel, not charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:diboson-2lOS", "why": "Estimates a different background (diboson) in the 2ℓOS channel, not charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:nonprompt-multilepton", "why": "Estimates a different background (nonprompt leptons) in the multilepton channel, not charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "why": "Estimates a different background (jet-to-tau misidentification) in various channels, not charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:prompt-multilepton", "why": "Estimates a different background (prompt backgrounds) in the multilepton channel, not charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:misid_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "why": "This is a misidentified-lepton background but for a different channel (ltau_lprime)."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:qcd-singlelepton", "why": "This is a QCD multijet background, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:bbww_misid_lepton", "why": "This is a misidentified-lepton background but for a different process (bbWW lvqq/2l2nu)."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:qcd-multijet-emu", "why": "This is a QCD multijet background involving misidentified leptons, but it is for the e-mu channel, not the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:feeddown", "why": "This is a feed-down background from psi(2S) decays, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:top-singlelepton", "why": "This is a top background for the single-lepton channel, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:ttbar", "why": "This is a ttbar background for the semileptonic/dileptonic channels, which is not specific to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "why": "This is a gamma+jets background for the ttH hadronic channel, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:gjets_vh_met", "why": "This is a gamma+jets background for the VH MET channel, which includes fake leptons but is not specific to the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:material-conversion", "why": "This is a material-conversion electron background, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:singletop", "why": "This is a single-top background, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:bbww_dy", "why": "This is a Drell-Yan background, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:diboson-rjr", "why": "This is a SM diboson background in a specific selection, but it does not specify charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:multijet_tchannel", "why": "This is a multijet background in a t-channel single top analysis, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:ww", "why": "This is a non-resonant WW diboson background, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:resonant_leakage", "why": "This is a resonant background leakage, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:diboson", "why": "This is a general diboson background, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:xg_conversion", "why": "This is a photon conversion background, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:ew-singlelepton", "why": "This is an electroweak background in a single-lepton channel, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:zgamma-conversion", "why": "This is a Zγ background related to photon conversion, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:z_plus_x", "why": "This is a Z+X background with genuine missing transverse momentum and SF lepton pairs, which is not specifically about charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 97.10483760107309, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 33062.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.1111111111111111, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.19999999999999998, "set_named_none": 0.0, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 73.0, "evidence_quotes": 27.0}}
