{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-80008fd1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Color reconnection (CR) model uncertainty (MPI-early-res-on, gluon-move, QCD-inspired)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty 'Color reconnection (CR) model uncertainty (MPI-early-res-on, gluon-move, QCD-inspired)':\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- 2103.04956: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2103.06956: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at √s=13 TeV\n- 2109.13808: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\n- 2109.13808: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the W boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at √s=13 TeV in the H→γγ channel using 139 fb^-1 of pp collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- 2307.01094: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of t tbar b bbar production in the lepton+jets channel at √s=13 TeV\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using di