ctly related to the non-VH Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, tth)."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "why": "This is a background from jets misidentified as tau_h candidates, which is not directly related to the non-VH Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, tth)."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:nonprompt_wz_ttz", "why": "This is a background from nonprompt leptons and WZ boson production, which is not directly related to the non-VH Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, tth)."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 104.4637816734612, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 31322.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.14285714285714285, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.25, "set_named_none": 0.0, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 73.0, "evidence_quotes": 17.0}}
{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-cb658f9d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate the Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background:\\n\\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2012.03799: Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\penalty 10000\\\\ \\\\mathrm{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2102.01444: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2106.01676: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2202.08676: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2304.08962: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2404.06204: Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV\\n- 2405.186", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diboson", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 26.314}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result