 top quark, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttWZ-mc", "why": "This sample involves a top quark and a diboson, but the focus is on the top quark, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttw-ttz", "why": "This sample involves top quarks and a boson, but the focus is on the top quark, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:tZ-mc", "why": "This sample involves a top quark and a boson, but the focus is on the top quark, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:wz-jets", "why": "This sample involves jets and a boson, but the focus is on the jets, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:background-zjets", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:z_jets_madgraph_pythia6", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:zjets_madgraph", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:zjets", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:zjets-mg5-amcnlo", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:wh-zh-mc", "why": "Wh and Zh are not diboson processes."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:wjets", "why": "W+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttz-ttw-etc-mc", "why": "TTV processes are not diboson processes."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:singletop-powheg", "why": "Single top is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:leptoquark_signal", "why": "Leptoquark is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttbar", "why": "TTbar is not a diboson process."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 101.12381120026112, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 32909.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0