{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-52eb2efa", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Multijet background process?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate the Multijet background process: \\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2012.01581: Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- 2202.08676: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2209.07327: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2403.01556: Search for dark QCD with emerging jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2404.06204: Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV\\n- 2405.18661: CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement\\n- 2408.03744: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\\n- 2503.19420: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\\n- 2510.07527: HH->bb tautau analysis result\\n- 2510.07527: HH->bb", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Multijet", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 24.054}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepkg:result:6bc442f4