e level, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:electron_signal_detector", "why": "Describes a primary electron at the detector level, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:extra_jet_particle", "why": "Represents an additional jet at the particle level, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:top_quark_particle", "why": "Describes a particle-level top quark/antiquark candidate, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:electron_veto_detector", "why": "Refers to a veto electron at the detector level, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:lepton_particle", "why": "Describes a particle-level dressed lepton, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:electron-candidate", "why": "Refers to a candidate electron, which is not the same as a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:lepton_stxs_particle", "why": "Describes a lepton (e, mu, tau) at the particle level, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:VR-Z-VV-btag", "why": "Refers to a validation region for multi-boson background, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:stxs_fiducial_jet", "why": "Describes a fiducial jet at the particle level, not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:soft-b-tag", "why": "Refers to a soft b-tag, which is not a charged-particle ID track."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:ni_candidate_vertex", "why": "Nuclear interaction (NI) candidate vertex is a specific type of vertex but not directly related to charged-particle ID tracks."}, {"id": "hepkg:object:primary_vertex", "why": "vertex identification BDT vertex is a method for identifying vertices, which is related to the broader context of particle tracking but not specifically to charged-particle ID tracks."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": 