{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-536d7b73", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $t\\bar{t}H$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following 12 analyses estimate the $t\\bar{t}H$ background:\n\n- 2004.04545: $CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2102.01444: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2109.13808: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\n- 2109.13808: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2211.08028: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more $b$ -jets in 139 fb -1 of proton–proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2304.08962: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2503.19420: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "t tbar H", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 24.355}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.03}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepkg:result:33a6f7b6bd891f45d2688022", "hepkg:result:d0ff6542be328ba2a125a5cb", "hepkg:result:vbf_hvv_polarization_analysis", "hepkg:result:ggf2jets_cp_analysis"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:ggf_contamination", "hepkg:background:minor-rare-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:other", "hepkg:background:other-higgs", "hepkg:background:other_higgs", "hepkg:background:others", "hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:rare-processes", "hepkg:background:ttH", "hepkg:background:ttV", "hepkg:background:ttbar", "hepkg:backg