ss sections, not the total cross section itself."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "why": "This is a differential fiducial cross section, which is more specific and not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_z", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (Z) and includes branching fractions, not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_wplus", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (W+) and includes branching fractions, not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (t-tbar-W), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "why": "This is a differential cross section, not a total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "This is about effective couplings and total width, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_inel", "why": "This is the total inelastic cross section, not the total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "why": "This is the cross section for a different process (ttW-), not the total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec", "why": "This is the cross section for a different process (ttW+), not the total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wz", "why": "This is a ratio of cross sections, not the total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_production", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wpm", "why": "This is a ratio of cross sections, not the total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-fiducial-xsec", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for a different process (ttW), not the total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "h