rate times branching ratio for a specific process, not a total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:pt_h", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution, not a total cross section measurement."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible", "why": "This is a branching fraction, not a total cross section measurement."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-h-differential", "why": "Signal strength in specific pT bins, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:stxs_stage12_xsec", "why": "Differential cross section times branching fraction, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_undetected", "why": "Branching fraction to undetected final states, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_per_mode", "why": "Signal strength modifiers for production modes, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:stxs-xsec", "why": "Differential cross section for H→WW, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-h-inclusive", "why": "Signal strength in an inclusive region, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:vhh_signal_strength", "why": "Signal strength for VHH production, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-pt-z", "why": "Differential cross section for WZ, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_inclusive", "why": "Inclusive fiducial cross section for H→4ℓ, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_prod_decay", "why": "Signal strength modifier per production process and decay channel, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_inclusive", "why": "Inclusive signal strength modifier, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:R_b_over_j", "why": "Ratio of cross sections for Z+b jets to Z+jets, not total cross section"}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_j", "why": "Ratio of cross sections for Z+c jets to Z+jets, not total cross section"}, {"id": "