y, not color reconnection model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:qcd_multijet_stat", "why": "This is about misidentification factor in QCD multijet background estimation, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jes-jer", "why": "This is about jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:cr-sr-kinematic-diff", "why": "This is about CR/SR differences uncertainty, which could be related to color reconnection but is not specifically about the CR model uncertainty as asked."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:renorm-fact-scale-vjets", "why": "This is about renormalization and factorization scale variation uncertainty for V+jets, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pdf", "why": "This is about parton distribution function uncertainty, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ps_isr", "why": "This is about parton shower scale uncertainty for initial-state radiation, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:met-unclustered-energy-scale", "why": "This is about unclustered energy scale uncertainty, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-modelling", "why": "This is about ttbar modelling uncertainty, which includes various aspects of the simulation but is not specifically about the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:multijet_modelling", "why": "This is about multi-jet uncertainty, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pdf_uncertainty", "why": "This is about PDF uncertainty on signal acceptance, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:theory_scale_pdf_alphas", "why": "This is about renormalization/factorization scale, alpha_S, and PDF uncertainties on simulated process cross sections, which is unrelated to the CR model uncertainty."