{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-a0ff054f", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Single-top t-channel sample (Powheg-Box v1 + Pythia 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following 14 analyses used the sample 'Single-top t-channel sample (Powheg-Box v1 + Pythia 8)':\\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2010.14293: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb -1 of $\\\\sqrt{s}$ =13 TeV $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2012.03799: Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\penalty 10000\\\\ \\\\mathrm{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2106.01676: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2112.03161: Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV 