ut lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:sv-charge-determination", "why": "Specific to SV charge assignment, which is related but not the same as lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misidentified_leptons", "why": "Involves misidentified leptons but focuses on the OS/SS ratio, which is not directly the lepton charge misidentification uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-stat-ratio", "why": "Statistical uncertainty of background contributions, not related to lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-reconstruction", "why": "General lepton reconstruction uncertainty, not specific to charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_id_iso_efficiency", "why": "General lepton ID/iso uncertainty, not specific to charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-calibration-efficiency", "why": "General lepton systematic uncertainty, not specific to charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:charge_misid_normalization_unc", "why": "Normalization of charge misidentification, which is related but not the same as the uncertainty in cross section ratio."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_reco_id", "why": "General lepton reco/ID uncertainty, not specific to charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-energy-scale", "why": "Lepton energy scale uncertainty, not related to charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:total-xsec-theory-uncertainty", "why": "Total cross section theory uncertainty, not related to lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-energy-scale-efficiency-uncorrelated", "why": "Lepton efficiency uncertainty, not specific to charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_momentum_resolution", "why": "This is about lepton momentum resolution, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:inclusive_ttC_xsec", "why": "This is about the normalization of the ttC cross section, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wjets-cross-section", "why": "This is about the W+jets cross-section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson_normalisation", "why": "This is about the diboson cross-section normalization, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wh-xsec", "why": "This is about the standard model WH production cross section, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ew_ttbar_cross_section", "why": "This is about the EW + ttbar background cross section, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal_cross_section", "why": "This is about the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_iso_id", "why": "This is about lepton isolation and identification, not specifically lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wt_cross_section", "why": "This is about the Wt inclusive cross-section normalization, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_momentum_scale", "why": "This is about lepton momentum scale, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-id-efficiency", "why": "This is about lepton identification efficiency, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:mu-to-tauh-energy-scale", "why": "This is about mu->tau_h misidentification energy scale, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-displacement-efficiency", "why": "This is about lepton displacement efficiency, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:nonprompt-lepton-estimation", "why": "This is about nonprompt lepton background estimation, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:leptons-experimental", "why": "This is about lepton energy scale, resolution, reco, and ID efficiency, not specifically lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-xsec", "why": "This is about ttbar production cross section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson-xsec", "why": "This is about diboson production cross section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal-cross-section-theory", "why": "This is about signal cross-section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttv_tth_uncertainty", "why": "This is about $t\bar{t}V$/$t\bar{t}H$ cross-section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_trigger_efficiency", "why": "This is about lepton trigger efficiency, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal-pileup", "why": "This is about pileup uncertainty on signal yield, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:fake-leptons", "why": "This is about fake/non-prompt lepton background, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson_cross_section_theory", "why": "This is about diboson cross-section theoretical uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:rw-pileup", "why": "This is about pileup uncertainty on R_W, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:e-to-tauh-energy-scale", "why": "This is about tau misidentification, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:prompt-misid-rates", "why": "This is a general prompt and misidentification rate uncertainty, not specifically about lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:qcd_multijet_stat", "why": "This is about the statistical uncertainty in the misidentification factor for QCD multijet background, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-id-isolation-efficiency", "why": "This is about lepton identification and isolation efficiency, not specific