e profiling for m_gg."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:background_estimated_from_data_and_simulation", "why": "Estimates background using both data and simulation, but not specifically using discrete profiling for m_gg."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:signal_analogous_parameterisation", "why": "Models background analogously to signal SMEFT parameterisation, but not specifically using discrete profiling for m_gg."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:normalization-factor-fit-to-data", "why": "This method extracts a normalisation factor but does not specify the use of discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:background_parametrization_fit_to_data", "why": "This method uses parametric functions for background estimation, not discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:parametric-fit-vh", "why": "This method uses parametric fits for background estimation, not discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:transfer_factor_ltau_lprime", "why": "This method uses a data-driven transfer-factor approach, not discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:theoretical_cross_section_normalization", "why": "This method uses theoretical cross-section predictions, not discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:nnlo_kfactor_hnnlo_ggzz", "why": "This method involves a K-factor for background normalization, not discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:background_method:singletop-svmass-tail-normalization", "why": "This method uses the tail of a distribution for normalization, not discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp", "why": "This method uses a data-driven fake-factor/matrix method, not discrete profiling."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:data-driven-fit-normalisation", "why": "This method uses a CR-based fit, which could include discrete profiling, but it is not specified."}, {"id": "hepkg:background_method:cr_normalisation_fit", "why": "This method uses a CR-based fit, which could include discrete profiling, but it is not specified."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:explicit_smeft_parameterisation", "why": "This me