nd identification, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ecal_material_modeling", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to ECAL upstream material modeling, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:embedded-yield", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the embedded sample yield and muon trigger, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon-id-iso", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to muon identification and isolation, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_reco_id", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to electron and muon reconstruction and identification, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon-reconstruction", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to muon reconstruction, identification, and isolation, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon-selection-trigger-efficiency-uncertainty", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to muon selection and trigger efficiency, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_mc_stat", "why": "This is a statistical uncertainty related to the finite MC sample size in the muon channel, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ml-nonprompt-rate-eflavor", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the nonprompt rate in multilepton channels, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:syst:muon_reco_id_iso", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to muon reconstruction, identification, and isolation efficiency, not the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_total_systematic", "why": "This is a total systematic uncertainty for the muon channel, which may include the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction but is not specific to it."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_in_jet_id_efficiency", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to muon identification within jets, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-calibration-efficiency", "why": "This is a broad category of lepton-related uncertainties, but it does not specifically address the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon-efficiency", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to muon reconstruction, identification, and isolation, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_isolation_insitu", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to muon isolation efficiency, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon-in-jet-identification", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to nonisolated muon identification within jets, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon-scale-ccent", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to muon momentum scale, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ml-nonprompt-rate-eta-mu", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to the nonprompt rate of muons in multilepton channels, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:electron-muon-reco-id-iso", "why": "This is a broad category of lepton-related uncertainties, but it does not specifically address the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon-resolution-ccent", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to muon momentum resolution, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_trigger_efficiency", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to the trigger scale factors for muons, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-correction-merged", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to the ttbar correction, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:charge-flip-datadriven", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to charge-flip electron background prediction, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pileup", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to pileup correction, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:shower_shape_corrections", "why": "This is a specific systematic uncertainty related to shower shape correction, but not directly related to the L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:high-d0-tracking-efficiency", "why": "This is about tracking efficiency uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:trigger-efficiency", "why": "This is about trigger efficiency correction uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:btag_efficiency", "why": "This is about b tagging efficiency and misidentification correction uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:nlo-ew-corrections", "why": "This is about NLO electroweak correction systematic uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-energy-scale", "why": "This is about lepton energy scale uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:afp-correction-total-uncertainty", "why": "This is about the overall C_AFP correction factor uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-displacement-efficiency", "why": "This is about lepton displacement efficiency uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:deepak8-lightqg-score", "why": "This is about DeepAK8 light quark/gluon score correction uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:b_tagging", "why": "This is about b-tagging efficiency correction-factor uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-ht-correction", "why": "This is about H_T distribution correction uncertainty for ttbar background, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:b_jet_msv_shape_correction", "why": "This is about b jet M_SV template shape correction uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wjets-ht-correction", "why": "This is about H_T distribution correction uncertainty for W+jets background, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-reconstruction", "why": "This is about lepton reconstruction uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-energy-scale-efficiency-uncorrelated", "why": "This is about lepton efficiency uncertainty, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ew_corrections_ttz_ttw_qqzz_ggzz", "why": "This is about electroweak correction uncertainties for various processes, not L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 91.49036381114274, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 23515.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.04081632653061224, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.07843137254901959, "set_named_none": 1.0, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 81.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
