ifferent observable (transverse momentum of lepton from W decay)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:pt_ll_vs_m_ll", "why": "Measures a double-differential cross section but for different observables (dilepton invariant mass and transverse momentum)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:wpm-z-pt-ratio", "why": "Measures a ratio of differential cross sections but for a different observable (transverse momentum)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-detall-norm", "why": "Measures a normalized differential cross section but for a different process ($t\bar{t}W$) and observable (pseudorapidity difference)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htjet-norm", "why": "Measures a normalized differential cross section but for a different process ($t\bar{t}W$) and observable (jet transverse energy sum)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_pt_ttbar", "why": "Measures a double-differential cross section but for different observables (invariant mass and transverse momentum of top quark pair)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:pt_lepton_over_pt_topbar", "why": "This is a ratio of lepton and top antiquark transverse momenta, not related to the differential cross section of ttZ vs pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:stxs-xsec", "why": "This is a differential cross section but not specifically for ttZ vs pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_yabs_top", "why": "This is a double-differential cross section but not for ttZ vs pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_el_cross_section", "why": "This is a differential elastic pp cross section, not related to ttZ vs pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:dsigma-deta-particle", "why": "This is a differential cross section for W+c production, not related to ttZ vs pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "why": "This is a double-differential cross section for ttbar, not related to ttZ vs pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "why": "This is a differential cross section for Higgs boson, not related to ttZ vs pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observa