rvable:integrated-fiducial-xsec", "why": "This is an integrated fiducial cross-section for multiple processes, none of which is the one asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:njet01_vs_m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "why": "This is a differential cross-section but for a different set of variables and process."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-ul-ttbar-95cl", "why": "This is a differential cross-section but for a different process (T Tbar pair-production)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_njet", "why": "This is a differential fiducial cross-section but for a different variable (number of associated jets)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "why": "This is a differential fiducial cross-section but for a different variable (Higgs boson rapidity)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fid_ratio_wpm", "why": "This is a ratio of fiducial cross-sections for a different process (W+/W-)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_z", "why": "This is a ratio of fiducial cross-sections for a different process (Z)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_inel", "why": "This is a total inelastic cross-section, which is not differential and not for the process asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wpm", "why": "This is a ratio of total cross-sections for a different process (W+/W-)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_z", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for Z decaying to leptons, but not related to ttZ or pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_z", "why": "This is a ratio of total Z cross sections at different energies, not related to ttZ or pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential Higgs cross section, not related to ttZ or pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_stxs12_cross_section_times_bzz", "why": "This is a differential Higgs cross section, not related to ttZ or pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "why": "This is an inclusive ttW cross section, not related to ttZ or pT^Z."}, {"id": "hepkg:ob