{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-0f3e79dc", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Single-top simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the sample 'Single-top simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)':\\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\\n- 2012.03799: Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2102.01444: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2107.12553: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and W bosons using 137 fb^-1 of proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2109.13808: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\\n- 2109.13808: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\\n- 2209.07327: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2302.05225: Searches for lepton-flavour-violating decays of the Higgs boson into eτ and μτ in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2303.15340: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton t̄t production measured in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2307.01094: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of t̄tW production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2404.06204: Precise measurements of W - and Z -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using pp collisions at √s=5.02 TeV and 13 TeV\\n- 2407.10549: Search for dark matter produced in association with a dark Higgs boson in the b̄b final state using pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2503.19420: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into WW* with the ATLAS detector at √s=13 TeV\", \"papers_from\": \"set_2\", \"answerable\":", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2509.22535", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Single-top simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 64.468}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f