{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-204cfd27", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Signal strength mu = (sigma_H/sigma_H^SM) x B(H->inv)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses measured the signal strength \\( \\mu = \\\\frac{\\sigma_H}{\\sigma_H^{SM}} \\\\times B(H \\\\rightarrow \\\\text{inv}) \\):\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( \\\\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV} \\) in the \\( H \\\\to \\\\gamma\\\\gamma \\) channel using \\( 139\\\\,\\\\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment.\n- **2503.19420**: Observed \\( VH \\) signal strength, combined 1-POI fit; Observed \\( WH \\) signal strength, combined 2-POI fit; Observed \\( ZH \\) signal strength, combined 2-POI fit; Compatibility test of observed \\( \\\\mu_{WH} \\) and \\( \\\\mu_{ZH} \\) with each other and with the SM.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2602.18611**: Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength measurement; Per-decay-channel Higgs boson signal strength measurement; Most granular 97-POI STXS-bin-times-decay-channel signal strength measurement; Effective coupling modifier fit with \\( B_{\\\\text{inv}} \\), \\( B_{\\\\text{undet}} \\) floating and \\( |\\\\kappa_V| \\\\leq 1 \\) constraint.\", \"papers_from\": \"set_2\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal strength mu = (sigma_H/sigma_H^SM) x B(H->inv)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 108, "error": null, "seconds": 213.01}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 29, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:muwh-zh-compatibility", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:granular_97