{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-29cdf3cb", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Background normalisation uncertainties (combined inclusive fit)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty 'Background normalisation uncertainties (combined inclusive fit)':\n\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at √s=13 TeV in the H→γγ channel using 139 fb^-1 of pp collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in pp→t̄t production at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of t̄tb production in the lepton+jets channel at √s=13 TeV\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of t̄tZ production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of t̄tW production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from pp collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2408.03744: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for W and Z boson production in proton-proton collisions at √s=5.02 and 13 TeV\n- 2508.13900: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2510.07527: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2602.18611: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2604.27044: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4b final state\n- 2605.14245: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Background normalisation uncertainties (combined inclusive fit)", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 104, "error": null, "seconds": 197.851}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 56, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77