ot the ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ sample."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:thqb-mg5", "why": "This is a tHqb signal sample, not the ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ sample."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:smeft_lo_signal_sample", "why": "This is a dedicated SMEFT signal sample, not the ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ sample."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:sm-nonggh-mg5amcnlo", "why": "This is a non-ggH (qqH+VH+ttH) prediction, not the ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ sample."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttbarV-mg5amc", "why": "This is a ttbar+V sample, not the ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ sample."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:diboson-madgraph", "why": "This is a diboson production sample, not the ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ sample."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttbar-madgraph-alt", "why": "Different version of MadGraph5_aMC@NLO and different process (ttbar instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:singletop_schannel_mg5amc", "why": "Different process (single top s-channel instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:twz-dr1-nominal", "why": "Different version of MadGraph5_aMC@NLO and different process (tWZ instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:wz-signal-madgraph-fxfx", "why": "Different process (WZ instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttbar_alt_me", "why": "Different process (ttbar instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttw-alt-fxfx", "why": "Different version of MadGraph5_aMC@NLO and different process (ttW instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttbar-alt-mg5-pythia8", "why": "Different process (ttbar instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:vh-alt-mg5", "why": "Different process (VH instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:gammajets_strong_mg5amcnlo", "why": "Different process (γ+jets instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ggh_vbf_tth_signal_mg5amcnlo", "why": "Different processes (ggH, VBF, ttH instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:tttt-nominal", "why": "Different process (four-top instead of ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:vbf-alt-mg5-herwig", "why"