{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-355bd42b", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM:\n\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{Te\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- 2103.04956: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2103.06956: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2511.11853: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2602.18611: Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength measurement\n- 2604.21670: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\n- 2604.27044: Resolved Run 3 analysis, first approach (transformer-based) HH results\n- 2604.27044: Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result\n- 2604.27044: Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 67, "error": null, "seconds": 171.936}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:61bead068d7011cdb8e37e4c", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:per_decay_signal_strength", "hepkg:result:per_prod_decay_signal_strength", "hepkg:result:per_production_signal_strength", "hepkg:result:resolved-run3-approach1", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2"]}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "hepkg:observable:acceptance_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible",