{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-66894990", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region '12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)':\n\n- 2103.06956: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2110.11231: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2202.08676: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- 2303.15340: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\;$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 264.266}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 54, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:61bead068d7011cdb8e37e4c"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:2l-tt-e-cr", "hepkg:region:2l-tt-mu-cr", "hep