gnal strength for HH production, not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_fermion_vector", "why": "This is a different observable, measuring signal strength for specific production modes, not the inclusive signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-vbf-vh", "why": "This is a different observable, measuring signal strength for specific production modes, not the inclusive signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ggh-tth", "why": "This is a different observable, measuring signal strength for specific production modes, not the inclusive signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_mass_profiled", "why": "This is a different observable, measuring the profiled Higgs boson mass, not the signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:signal-strength-per-mode", "why": "Signal strength modifiers for specific production modes in H→WW, not directly related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_by_production_mode", "why": "Signal strength modifiers for various Higgs production modes, but not specifically for the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-z-fiducial-validation", "why": "Validation of Z->bb signal strength, not related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:kappa-lambda", "why": "Trilinear self-coupling modifier, which is a different observable from the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb", "why": "Signal strength for VH production in the H→bb channel, not related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:observed-significance", "why": "Significance of the Higgs signal per production mode in H→WW, not directly related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "Effective coupling modifiers and total width, which are different observables from the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "why": "Resolved coupling modifier, which is a different observable from the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-wh", "why": "Cross-section times branching ratio for WH production in a specific rapidity range, not directly related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-z-inclusive", "why": "Signal strength for Z+jets (Z->bb) in an inclusive region, not related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_zh_bb", "why": "Signal strength for ZH production in the H→bb channel, not related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "why": "Kinematic distribution of the absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity, not related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_wh_bb", "why": "Signal strength for WH production in the H→bb channel, not related to the inclusive H→γγ signal strength."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:p-value-mu-h-compatibility", "why": "This is a p-value for differential signal strengths, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "why": "This is a ratio of coupling modifiers, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-zh", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific production mode (ZH), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-th", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific production mode (tH), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific process (VZ, Z→bb), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tth", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific production mode (ttH), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-ggf-bbh", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific production mode (ggF+bbH), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-vbf", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific production mode (VBF), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "why": "This is the branching fraction for a specific decay mode (H→inv), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-inclusive", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific process (ttbar normalization), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_ttH", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific process ($t\bar{t}H$), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mbb-spectrum", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution for a specific process (dark Higgs boson candidate), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_tH", "why": "This is the signal strength for a specific process ($tH$), not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_with_dihiggs", "why": "This is a constraint on the SMEFT fit basis, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_quadratic", "why": "This is a constraint on the SMEFT fit basis, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-zprime-hgamma-hbb", "why": "This is a different observable, involving a Z' particle and Higgs decay to bb, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:pt_h", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution of the Higgs boson's transverse momentum, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential cross section for Higgs boson production, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_branching_fraction_ratio", "why": "This is a branching fraction ratio relative to H→ZZ, not the H→γγ 