nergy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:electron-energy-momentum-scale-resolution", "why": "This is about electron energy and momentum scale/resolution, not tau_h energy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:renormalization-scale", "why": "This is about renormalization scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:unclustered_energy", "why": "This is about unclustered energy uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:missing_higher_order_qcd_corrections", "why": "This is about QCD scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:gghh-qcd-scale", "why": "This is about ggHH QCD scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:leptons-experimental", "why": "This is about lepton energy scale/resolution/reco/ID efficiency uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jet_energy_resolution", "why": "This is about jet energy resolution uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal-jes", "why": "This is about jet energy scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:photon_energy_scale_resolution", "why": "This is about photon energy scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:small_R_jet_JES", "why": "This is about small-R jet energy scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton-calibration-efficiency", "why": "This is about lepton energy scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:syst:hcal_inefficiency", "why": "This is about HCAL readout-loss jet energy scale uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ptmiss-unclustered-energy", "why": "This is about missing transverse energy uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar_qcd_scale_hdamp", "why": "This is about ttbar QCD scale and h_damp uncertainty, not tau_h energy scale un