ed background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-extrapolation-bias", "why": "Specific to the extrapolation bias in the background, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:minor_bkg_normalization", "why": "Specific to the normalization of minor backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:rare-normalization", "why": "Specific to the normalization of rare backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misid_ltau_lprime", "why": "Specific to the misidentification of backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vh-normalization", "why": "Specific to the normalization of VH backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:reducible_background_estimation", "why": "Specific to the estimation of reducible backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttx_normalization_unc", "why": "Specific to the normalization of ttX backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:qg_normalization", "why": "Specific to the normalization of q/g backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misid_ltau_had", "why": "Specific to the misidentification of backgrounds, not the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:symmetric_background_estimate", "why": "This is a statistical uncertainty in the symmetric background estimate, which is not directly related to the systematic uncertainty in the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistics", "why": "This is a statistical uncertainty in the Monte Carlo prediction of the signal-region background, which is not directly related to the systematic uncertainty in the predicted background level."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:luminosity_background", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the luminosity single-beam background, which is not directly related to the s