 a boson, but the focus is on the top quark, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:tZ-mc", "why": "This sample involves a top quark and a boson, but the focus is on the top quark, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:wz-jets", "why": "This sample involves jets and a boson, but the focus is on the jets, making it less relevant to the question."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:background-zjets", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:z_jets_madgraph_pythia6", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:zjets_madgraph", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:zjets", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:zjets-mg5-amcnlo", "why": "Z+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:wh-zh-mc", "why": "Wh and Zh are not diboson processes."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:wjets", "why": "W+jets is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttz-ttw-etc-mc", "why": "TTV processes are not diboson processes."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:singletop-powheg", "why": "Single top is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:leptoquark_signal", "why": "Leptoquark is not a diboson process."}, {"id": "hepkg:sample:ttbar", "why": "TTbar is not a diboson process."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 95.19622275326401, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 33577.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.0625, "set_recall": 0.25, "set_f1": 0.1, "set_named_none": 0.0, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 107.0, "evidence_quotes": 54.0}}
{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49057", "qid": "gen-conceptset-f12e5927", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "7b9f084cc5fb", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty 'Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty':\\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\\n- 2106.01676: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2303.15340: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\;$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2503.19420: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\\n- 2510.07527: HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result\\n-", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 78.278}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755